-- out/todo.txt --
v3 reports fewer position references in "field not allowed" errors (e.g. a.q.e has 1 position vs v2's 5). v3 correctly handles issue1867.three (close({}) + {...}) while v2 did not. issue3924.three.t1 and t2 have extra "field not allowed" errors for #job.other in v3. v3 shows issue3924.four.A.foo as ~(issue3924.four.#B) via structure sharing.
